\>", "Title",ExpressionUUID->"3611b672-1745-ae4f-b79a-2d3ed220affb"],

Cell["\<\
Single boundary velocity shape: sdot(tau) Cos[rExc Pi y/Ly]. Data inputs are \
current modal state plus instantaneous boundary velocity; targets are modal \
accelerations.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"7700a36b-8dbf-954d-aef4-916897914f84"],

